Yeek is a native Go API client built with MyGo.
Framework: https://github.com/egoist/mygo (MIT). See MyGo-LICENSE.

Behavior and model compatibility are adapted from Yaak:
https://github.com/mountain-loop/yaak
Copyright (c) 2024 Yaak (MIT). See Yaak-LICENSE.

The native UI package is extended locally in third_party/mygo-ui, based on MyGo v0.6.3.

PDF responses preview with PDF.js (pdfjs-dist 6.3.289, Apache-2.0), embedded in third_party/pdfjs with react-pdf's layer styles (MIT) and PDF.js's standard fonts. See third_party/pdfjs/UPSTREAM.md and DEPENDENCY_LICENSES.txt.
